    <div class="process-faq-list">
      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>How does the customisation process work?</summary>
        <p>Share your design brief and references via this form along with a ₹400/- per design advance. We send a draft based on your brief, incorporate any changes you want, and begin production once you approve the final design.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>What is the ₹400/- design advance and is it refundable?</summary>
        <p>₹400/- per design is a non-refundable advance paid to start designing. It is fully adjusted in your final product price once you approve the design and confirm the order.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>When do I pay the balance amount?</summary>
        <p>The balance amount for each product is payable only after the design is finalised and you've approved the draft we share.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>Can I change the design after seeing the draft?</summary>
        <p>Yes — we'll happily accommodate changes based on your feedback. Do keep in mind that multiple revisions may slightly extend the delivery timeline.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>How long does my order take to arrive?</summary>
        <p>Typically 7–14 working days from the day the design is finalised, depending on apparel type and quantity. We'll share a clearer ETA once your design is approved.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>Do you ship pan-India?</summary>
        <p>Yes, we ship across India and shipping is on us — no hidden delivery charges.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>Are the listed prices inclusive of design, print and GST?</summary>
        <p>Yes. The price you see for each apparel already includes designing, printing, shipping and GST. No hidden charges — same price irrespective of the design.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>What file formats should I send for references?</summary>
        <p>JPG, PNG or PDF works best. If your file is too large to upload, email it to <a href="mailto:fitkaarclothing@gmail.com">fitkaarclothing@gmail.com</a> and we'll pick it up from there.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>Can I order a single piece or is there a minimum quantity?</summary>
        <p>You can order a single piece — there's no minimum order quantity for custom designs.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="process-faq">
        <summary>Do you offer returns or exchanges on custom orders?</summary>
        <p>Since every order is custom-designed to your brief, we don't offer returns or exchanges once production begins. That's exactly why we share a draft for approval first.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
